WEBVTT

00:02.503 --> 00:08.973
Clone Seed into a new folder, sped up 8×

00:08.973 --> 00:14.478
One command writes the env file with fresh secrets

00:14.478 --> 00:18.645
deno task dev builds and starts every service, sped up 14×

00:18.645 --> 00:21.751
Every service is up

00:21.751 --> 00:25.085
The app, with a team's sample notes and tags

00:25.085 --> 00:31.920
Write a note and tag it

00:31.920 --> 00:35.270
Create it, and the whole team can read it

00:35.270 --> 00:40.877
Every group has members, each with a role

00:40.877 --> 00:46.510
The admin panel, on its own host: find a teammate

00:46.510 --> 00:51.672
Their sessions, groups and activity, at a glance

00:51.672 --> 00:54.490
The new note now leads the team's list
